# ABSulli quick-start config
#
# ABSulli can be configured entirely from the first-run web setup wizard.
# Most users can leave this file blank and visit:
#   http://<server-ip>:8272/setup
#
# Power users can pre-fill the Audiobookshelf connection below.
# See .env.advanced.example and docs/configuration.md for the full list.

# Optional: pre-fill Audiobookshelf connection in the setup wizard.
# When these are set, the setup fields become read-only.
# ABS_URL=http://192.168.1.50:13378
# ABS_API_KEY=your_abs_api_key_here